- Develop and execute large-scale, distributed and lumped-parameter hydrologic models for watershed water budget and streamflow forecasting.
- Conduct statistical hydrology studies, including flood frequency analyses (Bulletin 17C procedures), low-flow statistics (7Q10), and precipitation frequency estimation (NOAA Atlas 14).
